' SAFETY: hand-authored example for the safety-linter golden corpus (doc 69 C4). Not a
' vendor-manual-verified RAG example (Delta robot is still Tier B — see ../README.md);
' reviewed + validated in DIAStudio / on real hardware before any use. Motion/process only.
'
' POSITIVE example: the pick-place block only runs when DI(1) is set (a part-present /
' cell-ready digital input), so the motion + output block is guarded.
SPEED 40
IF DI(1) = 1 THEN
  MOVJ P1
  MOVL P2
  DO(1) = ON
  DELAY 300
  DO(1) = OFF
  MOVJ P0
END IF
